Append a new row to `resume/applications/INTERNSHIPS.md`:

```
| {Company} | {Role} | {YYYY-MM-DD} | Applied | {template} | |
```

Update the total applied count in the summary stats section.

---

## Hard Constraints

- **Never edit** `resume/templates/full-stack/`, `resume/templates/ai-ml/`, or `resume/templates/dev-ops/` — those are templates
- **Never invent** experience entries or company names
- **Never add** a new `\begin{rSection}` to the resume
- **Never shrink** font size or margins to fit one page — cut content instead
- **`company.md`** is written once per company and never overwritten
- **`@resume-writing`** owns all `.tex` edits — the pipeline never edits resume content directly
- **`@resume-grading`** owns all scoring — the pipeline never self-grades
